description: Deploy PartnerAppPortal only via publish-fix folders
alwaysApply: true
---

# Publish output

Always publish and deploy from **`publish-fix`** (not `publish-form`, `publish`, or `publishcd`):

- API: `C:\PartnerAppPortal\src\Api\publish-fix`
- Portal: `C:\PartnerAppPortal\src\Portal\publish-fix`

```powershell
dotnet publish Api\Api.csproj -c Release -o Api\publish-fix
dotnet publish Portal\Portal.csproj -c Release -o Portal\publish-fix
```

Do not use or recommend `publish-form` for Azure deploys.
